When processing payments from customer invoices or vendor bills, users can opt to utilize 
an existing cash register. By selecting a pre-generated cash register, the system automatically creates a cash 
statement line linked to that register.

Also provides the option for users can create cash statement lines without linking to a cash register. 
This option is useful for situations where a cash register ID is not needed or when transactions need to be recorded independently. 
The system will directly generate a cash statement line, simplifying the process for users who prefer not to use a cash register.

User can select already generated cash register and the cash register line will be created under that cash register , if you are use the "Using Cash Register" option.

System will directly create a cash register line (without linking the cash register) , if you are use the "Without Using Cash Register" option.
